<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Mineral Commodities raises A$3.3 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Mineral Commodities raises A$3.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mineral Commodities NL said on Tuesday it raised A$3.3 million through the placement of 5.5 million shares at 60 cents each.</p>
<p>The company said 3.25 million shares were placed with MacMahon Holdings Ltd and 2.25 million with institutional clients of broker EL and C Ballieu Ltd.</p>
<p>The company said funds raised would be used to fund an accelerated drilling programme at the Mungari West gold prospect near Kalgoorlie, Western Australia.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
